8,Buddhist Tibetan Musical Notations Resemble Beautiful Landscapes,https://mymodernmet.com/buddhist-tibetan-musical-notations/,"Buddhist Tibetan musical notations are as beautiful as they are sacred. The symbols look like tiny landscapes on the page.Beautiful Tibetan Musical Notations Visualize the Rise and Falls of Buddhist Chants. By Sara Barnes on April 30, 2019.",Lakha,Sino-Tibetan
9,All In The Language Family: The Sino-Tibetan Languages,https://www.babbel.com/en/magazine/sino-tibetan-language-family,"The Sino-Tibetan family has 400 languages. Fortunately for us, we can break this language family into 4 slightly more bite-sized branches. First up is Sinitic: The Sinitic languages include Mandarin and other Chinese languages (such as Wu, Yue, Jin, Min and Hakka).",Lakha,Sino-Tibetan
